==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nana & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Consider this stage something close to an early [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legend]] stage. It is a good idea to bring [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] or another unit with [[Critical Hit|critical hits]] so that it can deal with the [[Metal Hippoe]]. Any attackers you have can deal with the other enemies, such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]], [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|The Flying Cat]], etc.

